DESCRIPTION:Danny Collins is a third-year PhD student in Stanford Universi
 tyʼs Oceans Department whose research focuses on coral recovery in a rapi
 dly changing ocean. Rising ocean temperatures are driving coral bleaching 
 around the world\, threatening coral reefs and the ecosystems they support
 . But bleaching does not always mean the end for a coral—some are able t
 o recover despite these stressful conditions.\n\nDannyʼs research explore
 s how healthy corals can help accelerate the recovery of bleached corals\,
  o\n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-10-19 12:03 PDT
LOCATION:Hopkins Marine Station
