DESCRIPTION:Talk Title: Data Science at Snowflake in the Age of AI\n\nSnow
 flake is a cloud data platform that thousands of enterprises use to store
 \, analyze\, and build AI applications on their data. In this talk\, I des
 cribe two facets of data science at Snowflake: learning about cause and ef
 fect through experimentation and transforming how we work through the rapi
 dly evolving capabilities created by AI. Whereas experimentation has been 
 a staple of data science for years\, in the context of relatively small sa
